<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy" description="Read the MushroomScope privacy policy, including current data collection practices, storage, contact messages, and privacy rights."><div class="shell py-8"><Breadcrumbs items={[{label:'Privacy Policy'}]} /></div><article class="shell max-w-4xl py-12"><h1 class="font-serif text-5xl">Privacy Policy</h1><p class="mt-3 text-sm text-slate-500">Last updated: August 13, 2026</p><div class="prose mt-8"><p>MushroomScope is designed to collect as little personal information as practical. This policy explains the limited information processed when you visit the site and the choices available to you.</p><h2>Website analytics</h2><p>MushroomScope has paused Google Analytics 4. The website does not currently load the Google Analytics tag, send page-view or custom-event data to Google Analytics, or set Google Analytics cookies. Site-search words and related-guide clicks are not sent to Google Analytics.</p><p>Aggregate information collected before analytics was paused may remain in the MushroomScope Google Analytics property for the applicable Google Analytics retention period. Access to that historical reporting is restricted and is used only to understand past site performance.</p><h2>Local storage and cookies</h2><p>MushroomScope does not currently use optional analytics storage. A previous version of the site stored privacy choices in browser local storage and may have set Google Analytics cookies after consent. You may remove historical site data at any time through your browser settings.</p><h2>Advertising</h2><p>MushroomScope does not use Google Analytics for advertising personalization. If advertising technology or optional tracking is introduced, this policy and an appropriate consent experience will be reviewed before activation.</p><h2>Server and hosting records</h2><p>Our hosting and security providers may process limited technical records, such as request time, requested URL, IP address, user agent, response status, and security signals, to deliver the site, prevent abuse, diagnose faults, and maintain service reliability. Their handling of this information is governed by their own terms and applicable law.</p><h2>Contact messages</h2><p>If you email us, we receive the information you provide and use it to respond, maintain necessary records, prevent abuse, and improve the site. We do not sell contact details.</p><h2>Data retention and rights</h2><p>Information is retained only as reasonably needed for its stated purpose, security, legal obligations, or dispute resolution. Depending on your location, you may have rights to request access, correction, deletion, restriction, or objection.</p><h2>Contact</h2><p>Questions or privacy requests can be sent to <!--email_off--><a href="mailto:hello@mushroomscope.com">hello@mushroomscope.com</a><!--/email_off-->.</p></div></article></BaseLayout>
